{"seq":2,"slug":"spoilage-rate-fresh-pricing","title":"损耗报损率与鲜度库存定价（联167）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/coldchain-waste-ops/spoilage-rate-fresh-pricing","wordCount":2540,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"损耗报损率与鲜度库存定价-联167\">损耗报损率与鲜度库存定价（联167）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生鲜的成本结构里有一条标品没有的曲线：<strong>报损率随库存时间加速上升</strong>。一批货到库时损耗近乎为零，过了某个点后损耗开始爬升，临近保质期时损耗陡然变成全部。这条曲线的形状决定了定价问题不是&quot;卖多少钱&quot;，而是**&quot;在什么时点用什么价格，把货在过期前清掉&quot;**。</p>\n<p>因此鲜度定价是一个<strong>动态规划问题</strong>：剩余货架期是状态变量，价格是控制变量，报损是惩罚项。目标是最大化&quot;售出收入 + 剩余残值&quot;，而残值随时间是递减的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[批次入库] --&gt; B[剩余货架期 RSL]&#10;  B --&gt; C{RSL 分段}&#10;  C --&gt;|充裕 &gt;50%| D[正常定价]&#10;  C --&gt;|中等 20-50%| E[轻度促销]&#10;  C --&gt;|紧张 5-20%| F[深度促销]&#10;  C --&gt;|临界 &lt;5%| G[渠道降级/加工用途]&#10;  G --&gt; H{能否消化?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[报损]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[低价清出]&#10;  D --&gt; K[监测实际消化速度]&#10;  E --&gt; K&#10;  F --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L{偏离预期?}&#10;  L --&gt;|是| C&#10;  L --&gt;|否| M[保持]\">graph TD\n  A[批次入库] --&gt; B[剩余货架期 RSL]\n  B --&gt; C{RSL 分段}\n  C --&gt;|充裕 &gt;50%| D[正常定价]\n  C --&gt;|中等 20-50%| E[轻度促销]\n  C --&gt;|紧张 5-20%| F[深度促销]\n  C --&gt;|临界 &lt;5%| G[渠道降级/加工用途]\n  G --&gt; H{能否消化?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[报损]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[低价清出]\n  D --&gt; K[监测实际消化速度]\n  E --&gt; K\n  F --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L{偏离预期?}\n  L --&gt;|是| C\n  L --&gt;|否| M[保持]</pre><h2 id=\"报损率的度量\">报损率的度量</h2><h3 id=\"报损不是单一指标-是四层分解\">报损不是单一指标，是四层分解</h3><p>把&quot;损耗&quot;当成一个数字管理，会掩盖真正的根因。可落地的分解是按<strong>发生环节</strong>拆成四层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>损耗类型</th>\n<th>典型根因</th>\n<th>可控性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在途</td>\n<td>运输损耗</td>\n<td>超温、挤压、延误</td>\n<td>中（承运商管理）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入库</td>\n<td>验收扣重</td>\n<td>自然失重、分拣剔除</td>\n<td>高（标准明确）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在库</td>\n<td>存储损耗</td>\n<td>过期、冷害、鼠虫</td>\n<td>高（FEFO 与温控）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出库后</td>\n<td>逆向损耗</td>\n<td>客户退货、退货后不可再售</td>\n<td>中（拒收政策）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个环节的损耗<strong>不能简单相加成一个报损率</strong>，因为它们的改善手段完全不同。正确的做法是分别设目标、分别归因。行业里报损率的基准值随品类差异极大（叶菜远高于根茎、活鲜远高于冻品），因此<strong>只能用自身历史基线做对比</strong>，而不是照搬外部数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"报损率的分母选择\">报损率的分母选择</h3><p>一个容易被忽略的定义问题：报损率的分母是<strong>进货金额</strong>还是<strong>销售金额</strong>？两者算出来的数字差别很大，且在同一家公司内部不统一会导致跨部门争议。通行做法是明确声明：报损率 = 报损成本 ÷ 进货成本（按库龄加权），并把分子限定为<strong>已确认无法销售的批次成本</strong>，不含促销让利（促销让利是收入折让，不是报损）。</p>\n<p>这个界线必须划清，否则运营会把&quot;低价清掉&quot;记成&quot;报损&quot;，从而误判损耗水平；反过来，如果把本应报损的货以极低价清出却记为正常销售，会低估真实的损耗率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"报损的时间序列要做库龄分析\">报损的时间序列要做库龄分析</h3><p>单一时点的报损率无法指导决策。需要的是<strong>库龄分布</strong>：当前库存中有多少比例的货处于各 RSL 分段。这个分布预测了<strong>未来的报损</strong>——今天压在 5% 以下 RSL 段的比例，就是明天大概率要报损的量。因此库龄分布是比报损率更前置的指标。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  CASE&#10;    WHEN remaining_days &gt; 0.5 * base_shelf_days THEN &#39;fresh&#39;&#10;    WHEN remaining_days &gt; 0.2 * base_shelf_days THEN &#39;mid&#39;&#10;    WHEN remaining_days &gt; 0.05 * base_shelf_days THEN &#39;urgent&#39;&#10;    ELSE &#39;critical&#39;&#10;  END AS age_bucket,&#10;  SUM(cost_amount) AS cost_amount,&#10;  SUM(qty_available) AS qty&#10;FROM batch_inventory&#10;WHERE status IN (&#39;sellable&#39;, &#39;frozen&#39;)&#10;GROUP BY 1&#10;ORDER BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_shelf_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fresh'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_shelf_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mid'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">05</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_shelf_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'urgent'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'critical'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cost_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty_available) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_inventory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sellable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'frozen'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询给出的是<strong>风险敞口</strong>，而不是历史业绩。它的用途是驱动定价与调拨动作，见下一节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"鲜度定价的策略设计\">鲜度定价的策略设计</h2><h3 id=\"价格是-rsl-的函数\">价格是 RSL 的函数</h3><p>把定价写成 RSL 的分段函数是最简单可行的方案。分段点的选择决定了系统的行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def freshness_price(base_price, rsl_ratio, cfg):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;rsl_ratio = remaining_days / base_shelf_days, 取值 0..1&#10;    cfg: {&quot;mid&quot;: 0.5, &quot;urgent&quot;: 0.2, &quot;critical&quot;: 0.05,&#10;          &quot;disc_mid&quot;: 0.10, &quot;disc_urgent&quot;: 0.30, &quot;disc_critical&quot;: 0.55}&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    if rsl_ratio &gt; cfg[&quot;mid&quot;]:&#10;        return base_price                      # 正常价，不动&#10;    if rsl_ratio &gt; cfg[&quot;urgent&quot;]:&#10;        return base_price * (1 - cfg[&quot;disc_mid&quot;])&#10;    if rsl_ratio &gt; cfg[&quot;critical&quot;]:&#10;        return base_price * (1 - cfg[&quot;disc_urgent&quot;])&#10;    return base_price * (1 - cfg[&quot;disc_critical&quot;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> freshness_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(base_price, rsl_ratio, cfg):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"rsl_ratio = remaining_days / base_shelf_days, 取值 0..1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    cfg: {\"mid\": 0.5, \"urgent\": 0.2, \"critical\": 0.05,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          \"disc_mid\": 0.10, \"disc_urgent\": 0.30, \"disc_critical\": 0.55}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rsl_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_price                      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 正常价，不动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rsl_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"urgent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"disc_mid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rsl_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"disc_urgent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"disc_critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段代码能跑，但它<strong>不是最优解</strong>。问题在于折扣是阶梯式的，会在分段边界产生&quot;悬崖&quot;——同一批货在 RSL 从 20.1% 掉到 19.9% 时价格突变，可能引起客户的价格预期不稳定与内部的价格操纵。更平滑的做法是把折扣写成 RSL 的连续函数（如线性或指数），代价是价格可解释性下降。</p>\n<p>权衡取决于业务：C 端零售更看重可解释性（客户要能看懂&quot;为什么便宜了&quot;），B 端批发更看重平滑性（大客户对阶梯很敏感）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两类商品的两套逻辑\">两类商品的两套逻辑</h3><p><strong>短保高频品</strong>（鲜奶、面包、鲜肉）的定价应当与<strong>临期专区</strong>联动：把 RSL 低于阈值的货集中到一个专区，用醒目的价格差异引导价格敏感型客户主动选择，而不是全站降价污染正价商品的定价体系。</p>\n<p><strong>长保低频品</strong>（冻品、罐头）的定价更接近普通库存管理，因为有修复手段——重新分级、改变用途、跨市场调拨。它们不需要频繁改价，需要的是<strong>库存周转率的阈值告警</strong>。</p>\n<p>这个区分说明：鲜度定价不应全站统一，而应按<strong>品类的可修复性</strong>分类施政。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定价与-fefo-的耦合\">定价与 FEFO 的耦合</h3><p>定价必须与库位分配联动。如果系统先按 FEFO 拣货（先出短保批次），同时短保批次的价格更低，就会产生一个反直觉的结果——<strong>客户拿到的是最便宜的货，而平台清掉的是最难清的货</strong>，这恰好是想要的。但如果不联动，比如拣货系统按库位就近取货而定价系统按 RSL 打折，就会出现&quot;短保的货降价了但没被优先拣出&quot;，折扣白白损失。</p>\n<p>因此定价系统的输出必须回写到库位分配逻辑：折扣批次同时获得<strong>拣货优先级提升</strong>。这是两个系统之间一个很小的接口，但缺失它会让整个策略失效。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[RSL 计算] --&gt; B[定价引擎]&#10;  A --&gt; C[拣货优先级]&#10;  B --&gt; D[前端展示价]&#10;  C --&gt; E[仓储拣货]&#10;  D --&gt; F[订单]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[实际消化速度]&#10;  G --&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n  A[RSL 计算] --&gt; B[定价引擎]\n  A --&gt; C[拣货优先级]\n  B --&gt; D[前端展示价]\n  C --&gt; E[仓储拣货]\n  D --&gt; F[订单]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[实际消化速度]\n  G --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"目标函数与服务水平\">目标函数与服务水平</h2><h3 id=\"报损与缺货的权衡\">报损与缺货的权衡</h3><p>降低报损最直接的手段是不备货，但那样会缺货、丢销售。因此存在一个<strong>服务水平</strong>下的最优库存决策。库存理论给出的经典关系是安全库存与服务水平挂钩：在需求与提前期都随机时，安全库存为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS = z_\\alpha \\sqrt{E(L)\\,\\sigma_D^2 + \\bigl(E(D)\\bigr)^2 \\sigma_L^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.84em;vertical-align:-0.4541em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3859em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.054em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3459em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4541em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目标服务水平对应的正态分位数（95% 对应约 1.65），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(D),\\sigma_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单位周期需求的均值与标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(L),\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是提前期的均值与标准差（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safety_stock\">Wikipedia, Safety stock</a>）。</p>\n<p>对生鲜，这个公式必须加一条<strong>修正</strong>：安全库存会随库龄而<strong>变质</strong>，因此生鲜的持有成本不只是资金占用，还包括期望报损。实践中常见做法是给生鲜用一个<strong>更低的目标服务水平</strong>（如 90% 而非 98%），并用更短的补货周期来弥补——因为缺货的损失（损失一笔销售）通常小于报损的损失（损失整批成本）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个可用的报损目标函数\">一个可用的报损目标函数</h3><p>把决策写成&quot;在给定服务水平下最小化总成本&quot;，总成本包含持有、报损、缺货、订货四项。生鲜的特异之处在于报损项与持有时间非线性相关：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{total} = C_{hold}\\int_0^T I(t)\\,dt + C_{waste}\\int_0^T w(t)\\,dt + C_{stockout}\\cdot L_{lost} + C_{order}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5032em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5912em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5032em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5912em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位时间报损量，它随库龄单调增。这个式子没有闭式解（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 依赖需求实现），因此实践中用<strong>仿真或滚动优化</strong>求解：按周（或按日）用当前库龄分布与实际消化速度重算下个周期的订货与定价，而不是一次性求全局最优。</p>\n<p>滚动优化的关键输入是<strong>实际消化速度与预期的偏差</strong>。这个偏差在生鲜里普遍存在（促销效果、天气、竞品动作），因此反馈回路的频率比模型的精度更重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与损耗相关的合规与披露\">与损耗相关的合规与披露</h2><p>生鲜报损不只是内部成本问题，还牵涉两项外部要求：</p>\n<p><strong>食品安全法下的处置合规</strong>。报损的食品不能随意回流市场，销毁需要有记录与见证。批号、销毁时间、销毁方式、见证人构成一套完整的处置记录，与之前的温度记录共用同一批号主键（见 <a href=\"../temperature-monitoring-transit/lot-expiry-fefo-quarantine-stock\">批次效期 FEFO 与检疫库存</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>可持续披露</strong>。食物损耗与浪费是国际可持续议程里的明确目标：联合国可持续发展目标 12.3 要求到 2030 年<strong>将零售与消费环节的人均食物浪费减半，并减少生产与供应链中的食物损耗</strong>，其下设有食物损耗指数（12.3.1.a）与食物浪费指数（12.3.1.b）两个指标，由 FAO 与 UNEP 共同监测；据 FAO 的估计，全球约有 14% 的食物在到达零售之前就损失掉了（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sustainable_Development_Goal_12\">Wikipedia, SDG 12</a>）。对跨境生鲜企业，报损率从&quot;内部成本指标&quot;正在变成&quot;需要对外披露的可持续指标&quot;，这意味着报损的<strong>度量口径要经得起外部审阅</strong>——这又回到了本节开头强调的四层分解与分母定义问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>报损率随库存时间<strong>加速上升</strong>，因此鲜度定价本质是&quot;在过期前清货&quot;的动态规划问题。</li>\n<li>报损必须按<strong>在途/入库/在库/出库后</strong>四层分解，各层根因与改善手段完全不同；只能用自身历史基线对比。</li>\n<li>报损率的<strong>分母定义</strong>（进货成本 vs 销售金额）必须统一，且要与促销让利划清界线。</li>\n<li>库龄分布是比报损率更前置的<strong>风险敞口</strong>指标，直接驱动定价与调拨。</li>\n<li>价格是 RSL 的分段/连续函数；阶梯式可解释性好但会在边界产生悬崖，连续式更平滑但难解释。</li>\n<li>短保高频品与长保低频品要分类施政；前者用临期专区，后者用周转阈值告警。</li>\n<li>定价必须与<strong>拣货优先级</strong>联动，否则折扣批次不会被优先拣出，策略失效。</li>\n<li>安全库存公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS = z_\\alpha\\sqrt{E(L)\\sigma_D^2 + E(D)^2\\sigma_L^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.3038em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9362em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8962em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3038em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在生鲜上要修正：持有成本含期望报损，因此常用更低的服务水平配更短的补货周期。</li>\n<li>SDG 12.3 与 FAO 的监测口径正在把报损从成本指标变成披露指标，度量口径须经得起外部审阅。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"损耗报损率与鲜度库存定价（联167）","id":"损耗报损率与鲜度库存定价-联167"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"报损率的度量","id":"报损率的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"报损不是单一指标，是四层分解","id":"报损不是单一指标-是四层分解"},{"level":3,"text":"报损率的分母选择","id":"报损率的分母选择"},{"level":3,"text":"报损的时间序列要做库龄分析","id":"报损的时间序列要做库龄分析"},{"level":2,"text":"鲜度定价的策略设计","id":"鲜度定价的策略设计"},{"level":3,"text":"价格是 RSL 的函数","id":"价格是-rsl-的函数"},{"level":3,"text":"两类商品的两套逻辑","id":"两类商品的两套逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"定价与 FEFO 的耦合","id":"定价与-fefo-的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"目标函数与服务水平","id":"目标函数与服务水平"},{"level":3,"text":"报损与缺货的权衡","id":"报损与缺货的权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"一个可用的报损目标函数","id":"一个可用的报损目标函数"},{"level":2,"text":"与损耗相关的合规与披露","id":"与损耗相关的合规与披露"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"超温断链定责与保险（联072/111）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/coldchain-waste-ops/excursion-breach-liability-insurance"},"next":{"title":"冷链 SLA/成本与承运商绩效（联121）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/coldchain-waste-ops/coldchain-sla-cost-carrier-kpi"}}